s to data or model. All parties agree to maintain confidentiality of shared information for 5 years beyond contract completion.", "section": "6.0"}, {"title": "Compliance and Regulatory Requirements", "content": "All parties shall comply with: (a) DPDP Act 2023 for data protection, (b) HIPAA for healthcare data privacy, (c) GDPR for international data transfers, (d) ISO 27001 for information security, (e) SOC 2 for service organization controls, (f) Local healthcare regulations and medical device standards.", "section": "7.0"}, {"title": "Liability and Indemnification", "content": "Each party shall indemnify others against claims arising from their breach of this agreement. Data Provider warrants data quality and legal right to share. Model Trainer warrants model training methodology. CCRP warrants security infrastructure and environment isolation.", "section": "8.0"}], "title": "Confidential AI Model Training Agreement", "parties": {"ccrp": {"did": "did:web:cleanroom.com:user:ccrp3", "name": "ConfidentialAI Labs", "role": "CONFIDENTIAL_CLEAN_ROOM_PROVIDER", "email": "ccrp3@cleanroom.com", "address": "789 Security Blvd, Compliance City, CC 11111", "certifications": ["ISO_27001", "SOC_2", "HIPAA", "GDPR"], "blockchainAddress": null}, "dataProvider": {"did": "did:web:example.com:user:tdp.medical", "name": "MedData Solutions Inc.", "role": "DATA_PROVIDER", "email": "tdp.medical@example.com", "address": "123 Medical Center Dr, Healthcare City, HC 12345", "dataOwnership": "ORIGINAL_OWNER", "blockchainAddress": "0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000"}, "modelTrainer": {"did": "did:unknown:tdc", "name": "tdc100", "role": "MODEL_TRAINER", "email": "tdc100@dataconsumer.com", "address": "456 AI Research Blvd, Innovation District, ID 67890", "expertise": "MACHINE_LEARNING", "blockchainAddress": "0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000"}}, "recitals": ["Data Provider owns confidential patient health data for medical AI model training", "Model Trainer desires to train a 