odel validation: Cross-validation with 5-fold split.", "section": "3.0"}, {"title": "Data Security and Privacy", "content": "All parties agree to implement the following security measures: (a) Data encryption using AES-256, (b) Secure key management with hardware security modules, (c) Network isolation with VPN access only, (d) Regular security audits and compliance checks, (e) Data retention limited to 90 days maximum, (f) Secure deletion protocols upon contract completion.", "section": "4.0"}, {"title": "Payment and Compensation", "content": "Model Trainer agrees to pay Data Provider $4100 USD for dataset access and CCRP $2050 USD for secure environment provision. Payment shall be made in installments: 50% upon contract activation, 30% upon successful model training, 20% upon final model delivery and validation.", "section": "5.0"}, {"title": "Intellectual Property Rights", "content": "Data Provider retains ownership of original dataset. Model Trainer shall own the trained model but may not redistribute the original data. CCRP shall have no rights to data or model. All parties agree to maintain confidentiality of shared information for 5 years beyond contract completion.", "section": "6.0"}, {"title": "Compliance and Regulatory Requirements", "content": "All parties shall comply with: (a) DPDP Act 2023 for data protection, (b) HIPAA for healthcare data privacy, (c) GDPR for international data transfers, (d) ISO 27001 for information security, (e) SOC 2 for service organization controls, (f) Local healthcare regulations and medical device standards.", "section": "7.0"}, {"title": "Liability and Indemnification", "content": "Each party shall indemnify others against claims arising from their breach of this agreement. Data Provider warrants data quality and legal right to share. Model Trainer warrants model training methodology. CCRP warrants security infrastructure and environment isolation.", "section": "8.0"}], "title": "Confidential AI Model Training Agreement", 