IDATE_MODEL", "status": "PENDING", "trigger": "TRAINING_COMPLETE", "description": "Validate model performance against agreed metrics", "estimatedDuration": "4 hours"}, {"action": "RELEASE_PAYMENT", "status": "PENDING", "trigger": "MODEL_VALIDATED", "description": "Release final payment to data provider and CCRP", "estimatedDuration": "1 hour"}, {"action": "DELETE_ALL_DATA", "status": "SCHEDULED", "trigger": "CONTRACT_EXPIRATION", "description": "Securely delete all data and clean environment", "estimatedDuration": "2 hours"}]}, "compliance": {"auditTrail": [{"actor": "TDC_USER", "action": "CONTRACT_CREATED", "details": "AI training contract created with comprehensive specifications", "timestamp": "2025-08-30T19:30:41.336Z"}], "regulations": []}, "legalDocument": {"terms": [{"title": "Confidential Data Provision", "content": "Data Provider agrees to provide confidential patient health dataset (DS-MEDICAL-2024-001) containing anonymized medical records, diagnostic information, and treatment outcomes for the purpose of training a diagnostic AI model. All data shall be de-identified in accordance with HIPAA requirements and DPDP Act 2023 standards.", "section": "1.0"}, {"title": "Secure Training Environment", "content": "CCRP shall provide a secure, isolated cloud environment meeting the following specifications: (a) Private cloud infrastructure with dedicated compute resources, (b) End-to-end encryption at rest and in transit, (c) Access controls with multi-factor authentication, (d) Comprehensive audit logging and monitoring, (e) Data loss prevention systems, (f) Regular security assessments and penetration testing.", "section": "2.0"}, {"title": "Model Training Specifications", "content": "Model Trainer shall train a diagnostic AI model with the following specifications: (a) Model type: Multi-class classification for disease diagnosis, (b) Target accuracy: Minimum 95% on validation set, (c) Training framework: TensorFlow with privacy-preserving techniques, (d) Validation metrics: Precision, Recall, F1-Score, AUC-ROC, (e) Training duration: Maximum 90 days, (f) Model validation: Cross-validation with 5-fold split.", "section": "3.0"}, {"title": "Data Security and Privacy", "content": "All parties agree to implement the following security measures: (a) Data encryption using AES-256, (b) Secure key management with hardware security modules, (c) Network isolation with VPN access only, (d) Regular security audits and compliance checks, (e) Data retention limited to 90 days maximum, (f) Secure deletion protocols upon contract completion.", "section": "4.0"}, {"title": "Payment and Compensation", "content": "Model Trainer agrees to pay Data Provider $6000 USD for dataset access and CCRP $3000 USD for secure environment provision. Payment shall be made in installments: 50% upon contract activation, 30% upon successful model training, 20% upon final model delivery and validation.", "section": "5.0"}, {"title": "Intellectual Property Rights", "content": "Data Provider retains ownership of original dataset. Model Trainer shall own the trained model but may not redistribute the original data. CCRP shall have no rights to data or model. All parties agree to maintain confidentiality of shared information for 5 years beyond contract completion.", "section": "6.0"}, {"title": "Compliance and Regulatory Requirements", "content": "All parties shall comply with: (a) DPDP Act 2023 for data protection, (b) HIPAA for healthcare data privacy, (c) GDPR for international data transfers, (d) ISO 27001 for information security, (e) SOC 2 for service organization controls, (f) Local healthcare regulations and medical device standards.", "section": "7.0"}, {"title": "Liability and Indemnification", "content": "Each party shall indemnify others against claims arising from their breach of this agreement. Data Provider warrants data quality and legal right to share. Model Trainer warrants model training methodology. CCRP warrants security infrastructure and environment isolation.", "section": "8.0"}], "title": "Confidential AI Model Training Agreement", "parties": {"ccrp": {"did": "did:web:example.com:user:ccrp.trustedai", "name": "TrustedAI Environment Provider", "role": "CONFIDENTIAL_CLEAN_ROOM_PROVIDER", "email": "ccrp.trustedai@example.com", "address": "789 Security Blvd, Compliance City, CC 11111", "certifications": ["ISO_27001", "SOC_2", "HIPAA", "GDPR"], "blockchainAddress": null}, "dataProvider": {"did": "did:web:example.com:user:tdp1", "name": "TDP User 1", "role": "DATA_PROVIDER", "email": "tdp1@example.com", "address": "123 Medical Center Dr, Healthcare City, HC 12345", "dataOwnership": "ORIGINAL_OWNER", "blockchainAddress": "0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000"}, "modelTrainer": {"did": "did:unknown:tdc", "name": "tdc100", "role": "MODEL_TRAINER", "email": "tdc100@dataconsumer.com", "address": "456 AI Research Blvd, Innovation District, ID 67890", "expertise": "MACHINE_LEARNING", "blockchainAddress": "0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000"}}, "recitals": ["Data Provider owns confidential patient health data for medical AI model training", "Model Trainer desires to train a diagnostic AI model using said confidential data", "CCRP will provide secure, isolated cloud environment for confidential data processing", "All parties agree to maintain strict confidentiality and comply with healthcare regulations", "Training environment must meet highest security standards for sensitive medical data"], "signatures": [{"did": "did:web:acmehealthcare.com:user:sarah.johnson", "name": "Dr. Sarah Johnson", "party": "dataProvider", "title": "Chief Medical Officer", "signature": "0xabcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890", "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:35:00.000Z", "certification": "MEDICAL_LICENSE_VERIFIED"}, {"did": "did:web:airesearch.org:user:michael.chen", "name": "Dr. Michael Chen", "party": "modelTrainer", "title": "Chief AI Officer", "signature": "0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234